<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear about your recent experience with our Inflight Entertainment during your flight to {{{Case.Arrival_Airport__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We understand malfunctioning of our entertainment service can be frustrating.<br />
<br />
When this happens, our cabin crew explore multiple avenues to restore the service, from rebooting the system to contacting engineering teams on the ground for advice, but sometimes we're unable to resolve the issue before landing.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If a Frequent Flyer:-</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>A little something from us</strong><br />
&nbsp;<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If not a Frequent Flyer:-</em></strong><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.</p>

<p><br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that your comments have been passed on to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience — we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>